      "Calendar, Temporale, Sanctorale, Prefaces, preparation prayers and colophon outside PDF pp. 180-182",
      "Folio number (lxxx), illuminated border art, ink colour (red/blue), chant staff/neumes and diplomatic Gothic glyph forms"
    ],
